WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.196
Emerald Sprawl is no longer bracing for impact.

2
00:00:02.196 --> 00:00:04.392
Now the city is answering back, and every answer redraws who still looks in control.

3
00:00:04.392 --> 00:00:06.587
We have a developing situation in Rust Market runners.

4
00:00:06.587 --> 00:00:08.783
Recovery crews forced a visible closeout push through Rust Bazaar instead of letting debt pressure stay abstract.

5
00:00:08.783 --> 00:00:10.979
Behind the desk, the next move is already visible.

6
00:00:10.979 --> 00:00:13.175
Ghostline field GM: Replace rumor spillover with hard dispatch routing before the board loses coherence.

7
00:00:13.175 --> 00:00:15.371
Public trust now moves because someone closed the loop, not because a narrator said so.

8
00:00:15.371 --> 00:00:17.567
The city remembers the crews that move first and the districts that fail to recover.

9
00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:19.762
Tonight the city closes on this reality: Rust Bazaar is the hottest visible district at 77 heat.

10
00:00:19.762 --> 00:00:21.958
Rust Bazaar moved the hardest this turn with delta 8.

11
00:00:21.958 --> 00:00:24.154
Tomorrow the board opens again, and the next faction that hesitates will be seen.
